# Frontend Rules (React 19 + TypeScript + Vite)

Read dedicated rules under `.agents/rules/frontend/`:
- `.agents/rules/frontend/architecture-and-components.md`
- `.agents/rules/frontend/state-and-rtk-query.md`
- `.agents/rules/frontend/code-quality-and-formatting.md`

## Invariants
1. Feature-first structure: `src/features/<feature>/`.
2. RTK Query: configure tagTypes and invalidate tags on mutations.
3. Strict TypeScript: no `any`, types match backend models.
4. UI/UX: semantic colors (Green income, Red expense, Yellow warning), confirmation modal on deletion.
5. Verification:
   - `npm run lint`
   - `npm run format:check`
   - `npm run typecheck`
   - `npm run build`
